{
  "name": "Ashes Dark Covenant",
  "comment": "Dark Covenant (Keith Phipps, 1996; reuse allowed with credit) levels 1, 2, 4-8 and 11 with the Ashes 2063 weapons, human enemies, items, fog, gore and overlay HUD of tw_ashes.json. A third of the enemies are left out (thin_things) so each level fits the Cardputer's RAM; levels share 3 music tracks. Personal use only (Ashes art). Walls and floors: Ashes 2063 Enriched's own textures and flats (texture_match dir: Doom flats it redraws by name; other surfaces by kind - brick, metal, consoles, doors - then look; switches become console frame pairs). Decorations, dead bodies and keys: Ashes 2063 Enriched's own props, chosen by what each Doom decoration is (torches -> burning barrels or lamp posts, impaled bodies -> corpses, hanging bodies -> Ashes hanging body); dead marines use Ashes' lying player frames. Teleport fog and two powerups: Hacx. Explosions: Ashes HIEX; blood: Ashes splat, red only.",
